    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground, the advanced city of <strong>Umbral</strong> lies in silence. Strange silicon lifeforms stir in the depths, dormant robots await the call of their long-slumbering masters, and a lone scientist remains trapped, waiting for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasked with a mission to determine Umbral\u2019s fate before time runs out, with limited energy, every decision counts. <strong>Will you explore, restore, or destroy?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack</strong> city storage to scavenge vital materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snipe</strong> security drones with your long-range <strong>graviton beam</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb</strong> lost personality cores to upgrade yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568170/extras/594444b3571e85b45a5ff8cef48e4601.avif?t=1755461052\" width=355 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the city's <strong>45 districts</strong>, each linked to its vast neural network, you\u2019ll encounter strange and sentient beings\u2014<strong>Dendrone, Cybersaur, the Twins, and the Dross Bishop</strong>\u2014each holding fragments of your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when your <strong>BODY</strong> resists, something deep inside <strong>remembers</strong> who you are\u2026 until whispers of a <strong>THETA Military presence</strong> surface. A hidden faction, reawakening with an unfinished mission of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only <strong>five years</strong> before Umbral collapses, will you reach the city's core in time\u2014or be buried with its secrets forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568170/extras/2d5f8a684e772cd92ec4983de9ffc284.avif?t=1755461052\" width=300 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground, the advanced city of <strong>Umbral</strong> lies in silence. Strange silicon lifeforms stir in the depths, dormant robots await the call of their long-slumbering masters, and a lone scientist remains trapped, waiting for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasked with a mission to determine Umbral\u2019s fate before time runs out, with limited energy, every decision counts. <strong>Will you explore, restore, or destroy?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack</strong> city storage to scavenge vital materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snipe</strong> security drones with your long-range <strong>graviton beam</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb</strong> lost personality cores to upgrade yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568170/extras/594444b3571e85b45a5ff8cef48e4601.avif?t=1755461052\" width=355 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the city's <strong>45 districts</strong>, each linked to its vast neural network, you\u2019ll encounter strange and sentient beings\u2014<strong>Dendrone, Cybersaur, the Twins, and the Dross Bishop</strong>\u2014each holding fragments of your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when your <strong>BODY</strong> resists, something deep inside <strong>remembers</strong> who you are\u2026 until whispers of a <strong>THETA Military presence</strong> surface. A hidden faction, reawakening with an unfinished mission of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only <strong>five years</strong> before Umbral collapses, will you reach the city's core in time\u2014or be buried with its secrets forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568170/extras/2d5f8a684e772cd92ec4983de9ffc284.avif?t=1755461052\" width=300 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Cybervoid is a sci-fi story-rich choice-driven adventure. Sent on a mysterious mission, will you follow orders or forge your own path? Manage your time and energy wisely exploring a city on the edge of salvation or ruin and in doing so, ultimately discover your connection to this city and its fate.",
